# 95read agent conventions

- **Toolchain**: Turbo C 2.01, small model, ANSI C89. Declare variables at
  the start of a block; avoid C99+ constructs.
- **Line endings**: source files must use CRLF. Turbo C 2.01 silently compiles
  an LF-only file as an empty translation unit.
- **File names**: DOS 8.3 names only (no long filenames).
- **Breadcrumbs**: add machine-readable inline tags — `@mod`, `@region`,
  `@breadcrumb`, `@note`. See `BREADCRUMBS.md` for the index and convention.
- **No debug instrumentation**: do not add logging/`agent_log_*` code. Use the
  test harness in `tests/tmain.c` instead.
- **Build/test**: `scripts\build.ps1` and `scripts\test.ps1` run everything
  inside DOSBox (the 16-bit tools cannot run on 64-bit Windows).
